      "label": "Fit all other columns in the auxiliary regression · 辅助回归纳入全部其余列"
    },
    {
      "id": "6c2000000000000a",
      "fromNode": "6c1000000000000c",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "6c1000000000000d",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "Interpret the ratio against target uncertainty · 结合目标不确定性解释比值"
    },
    {
      "id": "6c2000000000000b",
      "fromNode": "6c10000000000006",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "6c1000000000000e",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Values measure strength; vectors identify directions · 值衡量强弱，向量指出方向"
    },
    {
      "id": "6c2000000000000c",
      "fromNode": "6c10000000000007",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "6c1000000000000e",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "Distinguish inverse smallest value from a ratio · 区分最小值倒数与奇异值之比"
    },
    {
      "id": "6c2000000000000d",
      "fromNode": "6c1000000000000e",
